<title>PHILIPPINES: MRC Allied says Q3 net at 15.64 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>MRC Allied says Q3 net at 15.64 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Industrial estate developer MRC Allied Industries Inc said on Monday it posted a net income of 15.64 million pesos for the third quarter of this year.</p>
<p>In an unaudited statement of income, MRC said it generated 73.66 million in revenues from July to September 1996.</p>
<p>Cost and expenses for the third quarter amounted to 49.58 million pesos. Comparative figures were not disclosed.</p>
<p>-- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418939 fax 8176267</p>
</text>
